      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "A housing adviser explained that a tenant should read the agreement carefully. She asked whether repairs were included and who was responsible for maintenance. Daniel made a list of questions instead of signing immediately. There were fewer vacant flats than he had expected, but he refused to rush.",
